urites like <strong>Cookies &amp; Cream</strong>, <strong>Lemon Meringue Pie</strong>, <strong>Super Bueno</strong>, and <strong>White Choc Biscoff</strong>, to viral seasonal releases, our handmade fudge is made fresh to order and shipped nationwide across the UK.</p><p>Now we’re inviting <strong>content creators, affiliates, and influencers</strong> to join the fastest-growing fudge brand online.</p><hr><h2>Why Creators Love Partnering With Chunk Fudge</h2><ul><li><p>⭐ <strong>UK’s #1 rated online fudge store</strong></p></li><li><p>🍫 <strong>FREE box of fudge</strong> sent to you to create an engaging unboxing / taste-test video</p></li><li><p>🎁 <strong>Your subscribers get 10% OFF</strong> on top of all our other discounts and offers</p></li><li><p>💰 <strong>Earn £4 commission via PayPal</strong> for every <strong>NEW customer</strong> who places an order of <strong>£18+</strong> using your unique link (first order only)</p></li><li><p>🇬🇧 <strong>UK-only shipping</strong> – focused, high-conversion audience</p></li><li><p>🚀 Proven viral-ready product – bold visuals, giant bars, and unforgettable flavours</p></li></ul><hr><h2>What Makes Chunk Fudge Different</h2><ul><li><p>Massive <strong>400g Chunk bars</strong> designed for social-ready content</p></li><li><p>Handmade fresh-to-order gourmet fudge loaded with real inclusions</p></li><li><p>Bright, gift-ready packaging perfect for unboxings</p></li><li><p>A rapidly growing UK brand with strong repeat-purchase customers</p></li></ul><hr><h3>Join the Chunkers Creator Network</h3><p>Promote the brand where <strong>“Fudge HAS to have Chunks”</strong> and earn commission while giving your audience the ultimate <strong>Chunks Of Yum</strong> experience.</p><p>Apply today and start earning with <strong>ChunkFudge.com</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></div>",
